    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Someone farts. Someone dies. And it\u2019s no accident.</strong><br>Welcome to <strong>Who Fart</strong>, an online multiplayer game where one player secretly takes on the role of <strong>The Farter</strong> \u2014 a sneaky saboteur who can poison rooms with nothing but visible, deadly gas clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The other players \u2014 just regular folks (or so they seem) \u2014 must complete simple tasks in places like luxurious villas or sterile office buildings. <br>But beware: an unventilated room could become your tomb !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you're making tea or tidying the game room, The Farter is closing windows, blending in, pretending to be busy\u2026 and waiting for the perfect moment to trap you in a cloud of doom. <strong>Can you unmask the traitor before it\u2019s too late?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1 Online multiplayer (4 to 10 players)<br>\ud83d\udca8 One traitor among you\u2026 and no second chances<br>\ud83c\udfe0 Maps: villa, open space office, and more to come<br>\ud83c\udf2c\ufe0f Dynamic ventilation system: open the windows, stay alive<br>\ud83c\udfae Interactive minigames for every task<br>\ud83d\ude02 A dumb concept with surprisingly serious mechanics</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nothing smells right here.<br>And that\u2019s exactly the point.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Fart</strong> \u2014 track the fart\u2026 or be the fart.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Someone farts. Someone dies. And it\u2019s no accident.</strong><br>Welcome to <strong>Who Fart</strong>, an online multiplayer game where one player secretly takes on the role of <strong>The Farter</strong> \u2014 a sneaky saboteur who can poison rooms with nothing but visible, deadly gas clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The other players \u2014 just regular folks (or so they seem) \u2014 must complete simple tasks in places like luxurious villas or sterile office buildings. <br>But beware: an unventilated room could become your tomb !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you're making tea or tidying the game room, The Farter is closing windows, blending in, pretending to be busy\u2026 and waiting for the perfect moment to trap you in a cloud of doom. <strong>Can you unmask the traitor before it\u2019s too late?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83e\udd1d\u200d\ud83e\uddd1 Online multiplayer (4 to 10 players)<br>\ud83d\udca8 One traitor among you\u2026 and no second chances<br>\ud83c\udfe0 Maps: villa, open space office, and more to come<br>\ud83c\udf2c\ufe0f Dynamic ventilation system: open the windows, stay alive<br>\ud83c\udfae Interactive minigames for every task<br>\ud83d\ude02 A dumb concept with surprisingly serious mechanics</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nothing smells right here.<br>And that\u2019s exactly the point.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who Fart</strong> \u2014 track the fart\u2026 or be the fart.</p>",
